---
import AnimatedSection from './AnimatedSection.astro';

interface Props {
  lang?: string;
}

const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;

// Real content - Malena Posadas / MXLXNX
const content = {
  en: {
    name: 'Malena Posadas',
    eyebrow: 'About',
    title: 'Multidisciplinary Artist & Designer',
    description: `I am a multidisciplinary artist and designer from Buenos Aires working across digital art, multimedia design, fashion, advertising, and entertainment. I'm driven by contrast, by the tension between the wild and the refined, the dark and the luminous. My work is rooted in emotion, visual exploration, and technology, always seeking imagery with intention and impact.`,
    description2: `My career was shaped within the audiovisual world through advertising, where I had the privilege of collaborating with exceptional directors and internationally awarded studios that expanded my understanding of visual language, storytelling, and creative boundaries. These experiences, working side by side with industry leaders, taught me the craft of transforming bold ideas into powerful visual narratives. I also explored the fashion world through my work with the Argentine fashion brand SADAELS and its creative director, where I discovered new dimensions of aesthetics, detail, and identity.`,
    description3: `I write stories, build worlds, and explore emerging technologies, especially artificial intelligence, as tools to expand what is creatively possible. I love experimenting, trying new things, and playing with ideas. I have a whole lifetime ahead to keep learning, discovering new worlds, and meeting new people.`,
    description4: `I am a young visionary with limitless drive, fueled by ideas and a constant creative pulse. I seek projects that challenge me, that awaken something powerful in me, that breathe with intention, and that pulse with risk.`,
    quote: `"If it doesn't feel like a bomb about to explode, I'm not interested."`,
    skills: ['Art Direction', 'Digital Art', 'AI Visual Art', 'Fashion', 'Advertising', 'Multimedia Design'],
    stats: [
      { value: 'Live', label: 'Action' },
      { value: 'Story', label: 'Telling' },
      { value: 'Always', label: 'Experimenting' }
    ]
  },
  es: {
    name: 'Malena Posadas',
    eyebrow: 'Sobre Mí',
    title: 'Artista & Diseñadora Multidisciplinaria',
    description: `Soy una artista y diseñadora multidisciplinaria de Buenos Aires, trabajando en arte digital, diseño multimedia, moda, publicidad y entretenimiento. Me mueve el contraste, la tensión entre lo salvaje y lo refinado, lo oscuro y lo luminoso. Mi trabajo está arraigado en la emoción, la exploración visual y la tecnología, siempre buscando imágenes con impacto e intención.`,
    description2: `Mi carrera se formó en el mundo audiovisual a través de la publicidad, donde tuve el privilegio de colaborar con directores excepcionales que expandieron mi comprensión del lenguaje visual, el storytelling y cómo empujar los límites creativos. Estas experiencias trabajando junto a referentes de la industria me enseñaron el oficio de traducir ideas audaces en narrativas visuales poderosas. También exploré la moda a través de mi trabajo con SADAELS y su director creativo, descubriendo nuevas dimensiones de precisión estética e identidad.`,
    description3: `Escribo historias, desarrollo nuevos mundos y exploro tecnologías emergentes, particularmente la inteligencia artificial, como herramientas para expandir la posibilidad creativa. Me encanta experimentar, probar cosas nuevas y jugar con las ideas. Tengo toda la vida para seguir aprendiendo, descubriendo nuevos mundos y conociendo gente nueva.`,
    description4: `Soy una joven visionaria con impulso ilimitado, alimentada por ideas y momentum creativo. Persigo proyectos que me desafíen, que despierten algo poderoso.`,
    quote: `"Si no se siente como una bomba a punto de explotar, no me interesa."`,
    skills: ['Dirección de Arte', 'Arte Digital', 'Arte Visual con IA', 'Moda', 'Publicidad', 'Diseño Multimedia'],
    stats: [
      { value: 'Live', label: 'Action' },
      { value: 'Story', label: 'Telling' },
      { value: 'Siempre', label: 'Experimentando' }
    ]
  }
};

const t = content[lang as keyof typeof content] || content.en;
---

<section class="about section" id="about">
  <div class="about__video-bg">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline>
      <source src="/videos/social_thelaundryman_a_vast_surreal_seascape_where_light_and_darknes_0d67bb3b-d3a3-428e-bf89-e8e4b8e1108b_0.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
  </div>
  <div class="about__container container">
    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__content">
        <AnimatedSection animation="fade-up" delay={100}>
          <span class="about__eyebrow">{t.eyebrow}</span>
          <h2 class="about__title">{t.title}</h2>
        </AnimatedSection>

        <AnimatedSection animation="fade-up" delay={200}>
          <p class="about__description">{t.description}</p>
          <p class="about__description">{t.description2}</p>
          <p class="about__description">{t.description3}</p>
          <p class="about__description">{t.description4}</p>
        </AnimatedSection>

        <AnimatedSection animation="fade-up" delay={300}>
          <blockquote class="about__quote">
            {t.quote}
          </blockquote>
        </AnimatedSection>

        <AnimatedSection animation="fade-up" delay={400} className="about__skills">
          <h3 class="about__skills-title">Expertise</h3>
          <ul class="about__skills-list">
            {t.skills.map(skill => (
              <li class="about__skill">{skill}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </AnimatedSection>
      </div>
    </div>

    <AnimatedSection animation="fade-up" delay={500} className="about__stats" stagger>
      {t.stats.map(stat => (
        <div class="about__stat">
          <span class="about__stat-value">{stat.value}</span>
          <span class="about__stat-label">{stat.label}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </AnimatedSection>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg,
      rgb(10, 10, 10) 0%,
      rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.98) 2%,
      #0d0815 8%,
      #0f0a18 18%,
      #150a1a 40%,
      #12081a 60%,
      #0a0f15 82%,
      #0a0c12 92%,
      rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.98) 98%,
      rgb(10, 10, 10) 100%
    );
    color: var(--color-white);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(150, 50, 255, 0.10) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 80%, rgba(255, 50, 100, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 60%, rgba(50, 150, 255, 0.06) 0%, transparent 40%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .about__video-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.2;
  }

  .about__video-bg video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about__video-bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg,
      rgb(10, 10, 10) 0%,
      transparent 15%,
      transparent 85%,
      rgb(10, 10, 10) 100%
    );
  }

  .about__container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about__grid {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about__content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about__eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--color-gray-400);
  }

  .about__title {
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-white);
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .about__description {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-gray-300);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about__description + .about__description {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-white);
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about__skills {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .about__skills-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--color-gray-400);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about__skills-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    list-style: none;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about__skill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    transition: all var(--transition-base);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .about__skill:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about__stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-top: var(--space-4xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-3xl);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .about__stat {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about__stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-accent);
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-white);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about__stat-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-gray-400);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about__stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
